-- src:4597 | (ii) in the case of a second or subsequent offence, seven years;
-- src:4598 | (a.1) in any other case where a firearm is used in the commission of the offence, to imprisonment for life and to a minimum punishment of imprisonment for a term of four years; and
-- src:4599 | (b) in any other case, to imprisonment for life.
