`s 239(1) the person commits the offence of attempting to commit murder` MEANS
    IF `the person attempts by any means to commit murder`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Every person who attempts by any means to commit murder is guilty of an indictable offence" (marginal reading M1)

@ref s 239(1) (src:4594-4599)
